# Scientific writing

Before drafting or revising academic prose in this project, read and follow
`.cursor/skills/scientific-writing/SKILL.md`.

- Style and integrity contract only — Caio owns ideas, results, and claims
- Point-first paragraphs; no AI-slop blocklist phrases; precise hedges only
- Methods: extractable tables/equations first; never fabricate citations
- Discussion/Intro framing: propose for Caio to own — do not assert unendorsed claims
